WEBVTT

01:50.360 --> 01:52.112
Let's go full throttle.

02:16.344 --> 02:18.054
So fun.

02:18.138 --> 02:21.182
You are so fun.

02:22.767 --> 02:26.312
More! Let's do more of this!

02:26.396 --> 02:29.899
I have never had so much fun!

02:29.983 --> 02:33.820
What is that guise of yours?
Hurry up and transform.

02:33.903 --> 02:35.655
I want to continue this.

02:35.738 --> 02:36.573
Crap!

02:36.656 --> 02:40.910
Takakura already went full throttle once
so he can't transform anymore!

02:40.994 --> 02:43.454
It's not over yet.
Nobody intervene, please!

02:43.538 --> 02:45.331
Grandma! We gotta help Okarun--

02:45.415 --> 02:46.291
Is that all right?

02:46.374 --> 02:51.087
If we intervene, that means
we're going to exorcise Evil Eye.

02:51.880 --> 02:56.009
Whatcha gonna do?
Want Seiko and the others to help out?

02:58.636 --> 03:00.972
Your knees are shaking.

03:01.055 --> 03:03.349
It's all you can do to stay standing.

03:10.940 --> 03:14.819
Hurry up. I hate having to wait!

03:14.903 --> 03:16.863
Hurry up and transform and fight me!

03:19.616 --> 03:22.285
No way. I don't want to bully weaklings.

03:22.368 --> 03:23.536
Huh?

03:25.872 --> 03:27.540
You can't beat me.

03:27.624 --> 03:31.252
I was convinced from our fight just now.
So I'm not fighting you anymore.

03:31.336 --> 03:33.880
How dare you! Who are you calling weak?

03:33.963 --> 03:36.591
I! Am! Strong!

03:36.674 --> 03:37.967
- Weak.
- Strong.

03:38.051 --> 03:39.177
Strong!

03:39.260 --> 03:40.386
Weak, so weak.

03:42.222 --> 03:44.015
Strong!

03:44.098 --> 03:47.227
I wouldn't mind taking you on
if you became stronger.

03:47.810 --> 03:50.396
What? I will become even stronger!

03:50.480 --> 03:54.275
But I don't wanna go at it
against someone who'd fight others.

03:54.359 --> 03:56.778
If you're gonna fight,
I want you to only fight me.

03:56.861 --> 03:57.695
Yup, yup.

03:57.779 --> 04:00.615
Fine! I will fight only you!

04:00.698 --> 04:04.827
But you said you were going
to kill all humans, so I can't trust you.

04:06.412 --> 04:09.290
I said, I am only going to fight you!

04:09.374 --> 04:12.961
But I'm busy with school.
I wouldn't mind fighting every so often.

04:13.044 --> 04:16.214
No way! I want to fight
every second of every day!

04:16.297 --> 04:17.632
Then, once a week.

04:17.715 --> 04:19.884
If you can't accept
these conditions, I won't do it.

04:19.968 --> 04:23.304
- This is unfair! You are unfair!
- Master, that's...

04:23.388 --> 04:24.722
This is great.

04:24.806 --> 04:28.643
Sheesh, you turds are a handful.

04:28.726 --> 04:32.897
Turbo Granny, what's going on?
What were you scheming with Okarun?

04:32.981 --> 04:36.901
He started saying some troublesome crap.

04:36.985 --> 04:40.071
Said he wants to be Evil Eye's playmate.

04:41.447 --> 04:43.533
When I previously fought Evil Eye,

04:43.616 --> 04:46.119
he said he wanted
to take playing seriously.

04:46.202 --> 04:47.787
I don't know the reason,

04:47.870 --> 04:51.666
but for Evil Eye, murdering
is the same thing as playing around.

04:52.166 --> 04:57.005
You said so yourself, Turbo Granny,
that Evil Eye is just like a newborn baby.

04:57.088 --> 05:00.550
If that's true, then he just wants
to have fun playing around.

05:00.633 --> 05:05.471
If I can overwhelm Evil Eye,
his attention will be concentrated on me.

05:05.555 --> 05:08.516
Then he won't harm Miss Ayase
and the others anymore.

05:10.435 --> 05:15.023
If I can become stronger, then I might
be able to become friends with Evil Eye.

05:18.818 --> 05:19.652
Then...

05:20.403 --> 05:22.822
Outside of fighting me,
you won't kill any people.

05:22.905 --> 05:24.949
We'll have one fight
every Tuesday after school.

05:25.033 --> 05:26.576
Does this sound good?

05:26.659 --> 05:28.077
Hold on a second!

05:30.288 --> 05:33.041
These guys want to kill off all humans,

05:33.124 --> 05:35.585
so they're saying
they can't agree to that promise.

05:36.252 --> 05:40.631
Until I butcher you, hold on to this.

05:40.715 --> 05:43.593
All right. We'll keep it stored safely.

05:43.676 --> 05:47.680
I want to kill you as soon as I can.

05:47.764 --> 05:49.307
So fun!

05:51.350 --> 05:53.770
Okarun, I...

05:53.853 --> 05:56.314
You didn't hurt anyone.

05:56.397 --> 05:59.442
From now on, nobody will get hurt anymore.

05:59.525 --> 06:01.360
You'll return to a normal life.

06:01.986 --> 06:03.404
Okarun.

06:03.488 --> 06:04.906
Nice weenie!

06:07.450 --> 06:09.869
Why is everyone so put off?

07:42.879 --> 07:47.508
I will take responsibility and store
this cursed item at my shrine.

07:47.592 --> 07:48.926
Be careful.

07:49.010 --> 07:51.137
If anything happens,
contact me right away.

07:51.220 --> 07:52.221
Understood.

07:53.181 --> 07:54.599
We'll visit again someday.

07:54.682 --> 07:57.643
Next time, make sure
you have a tsuchinoko in the shrine.

07:57.727 --> 07:59.687
I can't promise you that,

07:59.770 --> 08:02.231
but I'll be a sleeping bag BooTuber!

08:03.483 --> 08:04.525
Sounds good.

08:04.609 --> 08:05.526
See you.

08:09.363 --> 08:11.741
See ya, Manjiro!

08:11.824 --> 08:14.118
Don't let the curse cause an accident!

08:14.869 --> 08:16.162
Ms. Ayase!

08:16.871 --> 08:19.665
Thank you for all the trouble
that you've gone through!

08:19.749 --> 08:21.501
Jiji's mom.

08:21.584 --> 08:25.838
I'm afraid I can't say my care
was entirely the best. I apologize.

08:25.922 --> 08:27.423
Oh no.

08:27.507 --> 08:29.050
She's being polite!

08:29.133 --> 08:30.426
She's acting properly.

08:30.510 --> 08:32.929
Hey, why're you being so bashful?

08:33.012 --> 08:34.514
Stop that.

08:36.182 --> 08:38.976
Jiji, continue your training
to unleash your chi.

08:39.060 --> 08:40.728
The curse still remains.

08:40.811 --> 08:43.564
If something happens,
make sure to visit us right away.

08:45.149 --> 08:46.067
Okay!

08:48.444 --> 08:51.072
Everyone, I'm sorry
to have caused so much trouble!

08:51.155 --> 08:53.282
I will never forget your kindness!

08:53.366 --> 08:54.367
Pay us back.

08:54.450 --> 08:56.702
Don't worry about it. See ya tomorrow.

08:59.747 --> 09:02.291
Thank you so much!

09:04.168 --> 09:06.045
Man, I'm tired.

09:06.128 --> 09:08.464
Takakura, we should head home, too.

09:09.465 --> 09:12.051
Okarun and Aira, thank you!

09:13.219 --> 09:15.638
No, thank you for housing us for so long.

09:15.721 --> 09:19.058
M-Miss Ayase, I'll see you tomorrow.

09:19.141 --> 09:20.601
- Is that all?
- Huh?

09:20.685 --> 09:24.814
Um, was there anything else?

09:27.400 --> 09:29.527
Is that all?

09:29.610 --> 09:30.820
Jab, jab.

09:30.903 --> 09:32.280
Huh?

09:37.493 --> 09:39.328
What are you doing to Takakura?

09:39.412 --> 09:41.205
Shut up, ugly skank! You hurry on home!

09:41.289 --> 09:43.082
What was that? You swine!

09:43.165 --> 09:45.876
Miss Shiratori, let's go home!

09:45.960 --> 09:48.170
Damn you! Never come back here!

09:48.254 --> 09:49.714
As if I would, you swine!

09:50.298 --> 09:52.300
Oh boy. That was so scary,
wasn't it, Takakura?

09:52.383 --> 09:55.678
Oh man, it's all quiet here now.

10:00.516 --> 10:03.644
So this is what it feels like
when your mind goes blank.

10:05.271 --> 10:07.940
I guess we'll head to the super bathhouse.

10:08.024 --> 10:09.358
Hurray!

10:09.442 --> 10:10.651
What about me?

10:10.735 --> 10:12.028
We're all going.

10:12.111 --> 10:13.946
Hurray!

10:15.031 --> 10:16.824
KAMIGOE STATION

10:20.745 --> 10:22.163
NATURAL HOT SPRINGS

10:39.805 --> 10:41.599
Thank you very much!

10:42.433 --> 10:44.060
Man, it's cold.

10:44.143 --> 10:47.063
We warmed up only to get cold again.

10:47.146 --> 10:48.981
What are we gonna do about the house?

10:49.065 --> 10:50.858
We gotta rebuild it. No other choice.

10:50.941 --> 10:52.193
We have the money?

10:52.276 --> 10:55.905
Nope. That super bathhouse
was our last banquet.

10:55.988 --> 10:57.198
You're joking!

10:57.281 --> 10:59.825
We can go to hell now for all I care.

10:59.909 --> 11:02.828
I just started my part-time job,
so I don't have any money.

11:02.912 --> 11:08.084
Who asked you for money?
I'm not relying on your part-time wages.

11:08.167 --> 11:09.794
So pompous!

11:09.877 --> 11:11.754
You're always acting tough.

11:11.837 --> 11:12.922
Everyone was sleeping over,

11:13.005 --> 11:15.466
so why didn't you
collect expenses for their stay?

11:15.549 --> 11:16.926
Like I need any of that.

11:17.009 --> 11:18.511
Don't act tough.

11:20.221 --> 11:21.847
Don't overexert yourself, okay?

11:21.931 --> 11:24.016
Don't underestimate your Granny.

11:24.558 --> 11:28.187
But what should I do
about my The Idiot Shogun DVDs?

11:28.938 --> 11:32.108
I lost all of my Mr. Ken stuff, too!

11:42.159 --> 11:43.869
What the hell are you, punk?

11:43.953 --> 11:45.579
You're on private property!

11:45.663 --> 11:47.790
Where are you from, moron?

11:50.084 --> 11:52.128
Miss Ayase, hold on a second!

11:53.379 --> 11:55.506
Hey! You're all back.

11:55.589 --> 11:57.633
I got worried about your house,

11:57.716 --> 12:00.594
so Miss Shiratori and I
visited Mr. Mantis on the way home.

12:00.678 --> 12:03.722
We asked him if he could help out
with rebuilding the house.

12:03.806 --> 12:07.101
And he introduced us
to his friend Mr. Ludris.

12:07.184 --> 12:09.019
No way! I'm so sorry!

12:10.020 --> 12:13.691
He's saying it was an honor to be kicked
by a beautiful lady, deez.

12:14.984 --> 12:16.360
No, he's pissed.

12:16.444 --> 12:19.238
He is a construction specialist, deez.

12:20.239 --> 12:23.617
Leave it to him, and the rebuilding
will be done in a jiffy, deez.

12:23.701 --> 12:25.703
I'm sorry, but he's been
looking pissed the whole time.

12:25.786 --> 12:30.207
You're usually really busy.
Go home and play with your kid.

12:30.291 --> 12:35.004
I've always wanted to repay
my gratitude to you, Lady Seiko, deez!

12:35.087 --> 12:39.925
I've only been causing trouble myself,
so I want to do something for you.

12:40.009 --> 12:41.427
You too.

12:41.510 --> 12:45.097
You're barely standing up
so don't wander around so much.

12:45.681 --> 12:47.057
Hurry on back home.

12:47.141 --> 12:49.977
But you're also in a tough spot
right now, right?

12:53.022 --> 12:54.982
- I'm not.
- We very much are.

12:57.193 --> 13:00.404
If you insist on helping out,
then do as you like.

13:00.488 --> 13:02.823
I'm sorry, but can I ask you to?

13:02.907 --> 13:04.742
- Of course, deez!
- Yes!

13:06.619 --> 13:08.287
He's still pissed?

13:08.871 --> 13:11.415
Ta-la-la, ta-dah!

13:12.458 --> 13:13.626
Here.

13:14.210 --> 13:17.838
We'll use this nanoskin for construction.

13:17.922 --> 13:19.757
It's easy to use.

13:19.840 --> 13:25.304
Place the nanoskin somewhere,
and shape it like a clay figure.

13:25.387 --> 13:28.307
And you can make anything you like, deez.

13:33.020 --> 13:35.022
You can make anything, deez.

13:35.105 --> 13:37.691
What? Wicked! Let me make something, too!

13:37.775 --> 13:39.443
What the hell is this?

13:39.527 --> 13:43.948
The nanoskin is made up of
ultra-high-density nanomachines, deez.

13:44.031 --> 13:46.659
What is this? It feels crunchy!

13:46.742 --> 13:48.744
By the way, it's a shape-memory alloy.

13:48.827 --> 13:50.579
Even if it breaks,

13:50.663 --> 13:53.832
the nanoskin will restore itself
to its original form.

13:54.708 --> 13:58.379
Have a solid image in your head
of what you want to make, deez.

14:01.840 --> 14:04.802
The nanomachine will catch
the electric signals from your brain,

14:04.885 --> 14:07.805
and form the shape
exactly like you imagine it.

14:10.808 --> 14:13.519
I see. This is great.

14:43.048 --> 14:45.885
Thanks, Kappa. You saved my ass.

14:45.968 --> 14:48.012
It was nothing, deez.

14:48.095 --> 14:50.639
I'll do anything for Lady Seiko, deez!

15:00.566 --> 15:04.904
Mr. Ludris is also saying it was an honor
to be able to assist a beauty.

15:04.987 --> 15:06.947
You don't understand
what he's saying, do you?

15:07.031 --> 15:08.532
Thank you, Okarun.

15:08.616 --> 15:09.658
You too, Aira.

15:11.076 --> 15:13.787
Man, I'm sleepy. Let's hurry on home.

15:13.871 --> 15:16.415
I'm glad your home is all fixed up.

15:16.498 --> 15:19.126
It kinda felt like my own home,

15:19.209 --> 15:21.378
so it made me uneasy
when it wasn't all right.

15:24.423 --> 15:25.841
Indeed.

15:25.925 --> 15:29.720
It became a hangout for all sorts
of people before I knew it.

15:30.721 --> 15:32.598
We gotta protect it.

15:35.309 --> 15:37.353
Come by again anytime!

15:40.648 --> 15:41.482
Okay!

15:43.108 --> 15:46.487
Thanks, everyone! Come by again!

15:46.570 --> 15:50.240
I totally love all you guys!
You guys are lifesavers!

15:50.324 --> 15:52.826
We gotta pay this favor back.

15:53.494 --> 15:56.705
But for today,
I won't be able to make lunch.

15:56.789 --> 15:58.499
It's fine. Sleep in.

16:01.460 --> 16:03.754
Jin! You're slow! Bang! Bang!

16:03.837 --> 16:06.715
Mom! It's dangerous if you poke
your head out the window!

16:06.799 --> 16:08.884
More like, let me hop on!

16:12.221 --> 16:13.639
Dear, try to keep it down.

16:19.269 --> 16:21.105
Okay, we're here!

16:21.188 --> 16:23.649
All right, Honey, let's do this!

16:23.732 --> 16:25.776
Dear, please be quiet.

16:25.859 --> 16:27.486
Good morning!

16:27.569 --> 16:30.948
The entire Enjoji household
has come to rebuild the house!

16:31.031 --> 16:32.992
Dear, please keep it down.

16:33.951 --> 16:36.662
Huh? It's not broken anywhere.

16:37.913 --> 16:39.289
Oh, Momo!

16:40.708 --> 16:43.002
Grandma's asleep.

16:44.586 --> 16:46.755
I'm sorry for all kinds of reasons.

16:46.839 --> 16:47.965
Don't worry about it.

16:48.048 --> 16:50.217
More like, how's Evil Eye doing?

16:50.300 --> 16:52.636
Actually, about that...

16:52.720 --> 16:54.888
I've turned into Evil Eye a few times.

16:55.639 --> 16:59.810
Oh, Evil Eye didn't do anything.
He's really keeping that promise!

16:59.893 --> 17:00.728
For real?

17:00.811 --> 17:02.896
I don't know
if it's because of the training,

17:02.980 --> 17:05.357
but I feel a connection
with Evil Eye lately.

17:05.441 --> 17:09.361
His excited emotions
get transmitted to me or something.

17:09.445 --> 17:13.741
It's not just hatred. I think he's
enjoying this a surprising amount.

17:16.535 --> 17:17.953
I see.

17:18.037 --> 17:20.664
Well, if something happens, come visit us.

17:25.711 --> 17:26.754
Hey, Momo.

17:27.546 --> 17:29.131
Are you in love with anyone?

17:50.360 --> 17:52.529
Hold up, you look way too disturbed!

17:52.613 --> 17:57.159
Nuh-uh! Not at all!
Your words didn't affect me at all!

17:57.242 --> 18:00.621
H-Hold up! You're badmouthing me now!

18:00.704 --> 18:02.414
Oh! Enjoji!

18:02.498 --> 18:03.999
It's been a while!

18:04.083 --> 18:06.627
You've been absent from school
for some time. What happened?

18:06.710 --> 18:10.214
I was staying home with hopes
of making my cuties all antsy!

18:10.297 --> 18:12.007
What's up with that?

18:12.091 --> 18:14.259
Go get 'em, you flashy guy.

18:14.343 --> 18:17.304
Enjoji, this is the new Pompy flavor!

18:17.387 --> 18:18.180
Wanna try?

18:18.263 --> 18:19.515
Hold on a sec!

18:20.599 --> 18:21.850
You're wearing clothes?

18:21.934 --> 18:23.143
Where is this place?

18:23.227 --> 18:25.604
What'd you think of the taiyaki flavor?

18:27.147 --> 18:30.234
I'll butcher you. This is all too tasty.

18:34.571 --> 18:37.533
Come on, Jiji. That joke
is totally not popular right now.

18:37.616 --> 18:40.202
Oh, it's you. Do you want to be butchered?

18:40.285 --> 18:41.578
I said it's not popular!

18:41.662 --> 18:44.957
Your timing is terrible right now,
so can you go back to Jiji?

18:45.040 --> 18:47.668
No way. This is incredibly tasty.

18:47.751 --> 18:50.754
What, Momo? You being lovey-dovey
this early in the morning?

18:50.838 --> 18:51.797
As if!

18:54.842 --> 18:56.176
That's mine!

18:56.260 --> 18:57.719
What is?

19:00.180 --> 19:01.140
Hey, it's Jiji!

19:01.223 --> 19:03.350
You finally decided to join
the soccer team?

19:11.650 --> 19:12.943
Amazing!

19:13.026 --> 19:14.778
Get back here!

19:18.949 --> 19:21.618
I told you to stop!

19:21.702 --> 19:23.787
WARM
SOLD OUT

19:26.165 --> 19:28.834
Damn it, all the hot stuff is sold out.

19:28.917 --> 19:31.670
Hurry up and give me
that tasty drink from earlier.

19:31.753 --> 19:35.716
I thought I'd let him drink something warm
and get him back to normal.

19:40.554 --> 19:42.014
I have no choice.

19:42.097 --> 19:45.184
At least, it doesn't seem like
he'll attack people.

19:45.267 --> 19:46.852
I guess I'll just see how things go.

20:17.216 --> 20:19.134
What are you writing?

20:20.427 --> 20:22.179
All those I want to butcher!

20:22.262 --> 20:24.556
Whoa! Quiet!

20:24.640 --> 20:26.850
Hey, Enjoji!

20:26.934 --> 20:29.978
Who do you want to butcher
in the middle of class?

20:30.062 --> 20:31.813
All humans!

20:33.106 --> 20:36.777
He's kinda hooked on this one joke.
I told you that's not popular, you turd!

20:36.860 --> 20:38.904
SOLD OUT

20:39.488 --> 20:42.783
What? You're kidding me!
The hot food is all sold out?

20:42.866 --> 20:47.037
I'm sorry,
I'm sold out of most things today.

20:51.750 --> 20:52.751
Wait!

20:53.335 --> 20:54.336
Tasty.

20:54.419 --> 20:56.505
Here, use chopsticks.

21:18.151 --> 21:20.195
Baby steps, I guess.

21:20.946 --> 21:22.990
Hey, did something happen to Jiji?

21:23.073 --> 21:24.283
Like what?

21:24.366 --> 21:26.743
Was he the type to say butcher and stuff?

21:26.827 --> 21:28.370
Maybe he had a change of character.

21:28.453 --> 21:31.206
I know! Maybe the ghost from
the housing complex is possessing him!

21:31.290 --> 21:34.459
- What now?
- Maybe he has a golden ball on him!

21:35.210 --> 21:37.587
Wait, what? How do you know
about the golden ball?

21:37.671 --> 21:40.549
Oh, right. You don't have
a smartphone right now.

21:40.632 --> 21:42.968
It's a hot topic in the group right now.

21:43.468 --> 21:45.470
The ghost in the housing complex.

23:26.822 --> 23:30.075
I see you. I see you, my enemy.

23:33.203 --> 23:35.247
I'm talking to you.

23:36.081 --> 23:36.915
What?!

23:38.500 --> 23:40.961
Momo, is something on your mind?
Leave it to me!

23:41.044 --> 23:43.672
Next episode, "The Secret Art of Being
Attractive." C'mon baby!

23:43.755 --> 23:44.548
Man, my head hurts.

23:44.631 --> 23:46.216
Here's some painkillers!
It tastes like takoyaki!

23:46.299 --> 23:47.425
I wanna ice this guy's head.

23:47.509 --> 23:49.010
Miss Ayase! Please take these instead!

23:49.094 --> 23:51.054
- Thanks.
- I made them with nanoskin!

23:51.138 --> 23:52.931
Like I'd want to take anything like that!
